closedShare":2.6,"gap":{"cells":1,"directDeals":4,"median":null,"low":null,"high":null,"lowerShare":null}},"중랑구":{"deals":[88,81,81,124,172,134,171,267,118,126,291,239,97,150,190,200,226,383,312,211,502,193,141,88],"direct":[2,1,4,6,4,2,4,38,5,7,108,13,1,5,5,5,8,16,12,5,299,53,6,2],"share":[2.3,1.2,4.9,4.8,2.3,1.5,2.3,14.2,4.2,5.6,37.1,5.4,1,3.3,2.6,2.5,3.5,4.2,3.8,2.4,59.6,27.5,4.3,2.3],"closedShare":13.8,"gap":{"cells":5,"directDeals":17,"median":null,"low":null,"high":null,"lowerShare":null}}},"heading":{"ko":"직거래는 중개거래보다 얼마에 거래되나","en":"How do direct-deal prices compare?"},"lead":{"ko":"2024년 11월~2026년 8월 서울 아파트 매매 가운데 중개사 없이 신고된 직거래는 4.7%였습니다. 달마다 2~11.2% 사이였습니다. 같은 단지·같은 전용면적에서 견주면 직거래는 중개거래보다 중간값 13.1% 낮았습니다(90% 구간 -14.5~-10.7%, 양쪽 모두 3건 이상인 115칸). 그 칸의 89.6%에서 직거래가 더 낮았습니다. 자치구로 나누면 맞물린 칸이 가장 많은 구도 13칸이라(문턱 20칸) 구별로는 직거래 비중만 적습니다.","en":"From Nov 2024~Aug 2026, direct deals — filed without an agent — were 4.7% of Seoul apartment sales, between 2% and 11.2% in any one month. Within the same complex and unit size, direct deals were a median 13.1% below agent-brokered ones (90% range -14.5~-10.7%, across 115 unit types with at least 3 of each), and came in lower in 89.6% of those unit types. Split by district, even the best-covered district has only 13 such unit types (the floor is 20), so districts show only the direct-deal share."},"note":{"ko":"직거래는 공인중개사 없이 당사자끼리 신고한 거래입니다. 가족 간 거래, 분양·조합 정산, 모르는 사람끼리 시세대로 한 거래가 모두 같은 표시로 들어오고, 신고 자료에는 사유가 없어 왜 낮은지는 알 수 없습니다. 이 격차로 어느 한 거래가 특수관계 거래라거나, 부당했다거나, 신고가 사실과 다르다고 말할 수 없습니다. 칸은 직거래·중개거래가 각각 3건 이상인 같은 구·단지·전용면적만 세고(시세 화면의 칸 문턱), 자치구별 격차는 칸이 모자라 적지 않습니다. 두 해를 한 칸에 담았습니다. 직거래가 대체로 한 달쯤 먼저 계약됐지만, 달마다의 시세 변화를 걸러 다시 재도 격차는 줄지 않았습니다(2026-10-26 확인). 2026년 9월·2026년 10월은 계약 뒤 30일까지 신고가 들어오는 덜 찬 달이라 건수만 적고 비중은 적지 않으며 합계에서도 뺍니다.","en":"A direct deal is one the parties filed without a licensed agent. Transfers within a family, settlements with a developer or redevelopment association and ordinary sales between strangers all carry the same mark, and the filing gives no reason, so why they come in lower is unknown. This gap does not show that any one deal was between related parties, improper, or filed with false details. A unit type counts only when it has at least 3 direct and 3 brokered deals (the same floor as the price screens); districts have too few unit types for a gap of their own, so none is given. The two years go into one comparison. Direct deals were usually signed about a month earlier, but re-measuring with month-to-month price movement removed did not shrink the gap (checked 2026-10-26). Sep 2026 and Oct 2026 are still filling up — filings arrive for 30 days after a contract — so they are marked, their share is not shown, and they are left out of the totals."},"table":{"ko":"<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">자치구</th><th scope=\"col\">직거래</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>서울</td><td>4.7%</td></tr><tr><td>강남구</td><td>3.3%</td></tr><tr><td>강동구</td><td>4.2%</td></tr><tr><td>강북구</td><td>4%</td></tr><tr><td>강서구</td><td>5.3%</td></tr><tr><td>관악구</td><td>4.5%</td></tr><tr><td>광진구</td><td>6.8%</td></tr><tr><td>구로구</td><td>8.3%</td></tr><tr><td>금천구</td><td>3.5%</td></tr><tr><td>노원구</td><td>3.5%</td></tr><tr><td>도봉구</td><td>3.6%</td></tr><tr><td>동대문구</td><td>6.8%</td></tr><tr><td>동작구</td><td>4.4%</td></tr><tr><td>마포구</td><td>2%</td></tr><tr><td>서대문구</td><td>4.6%</td></tr><tr><td>서초구</td><td>4.3%</td></tr><tr><td>성동구</td><td>4.1%</td></tr><tr><td>성북구</td><td>3.3%</td></tr><tr><td>송파구</td><td>2.8%</td></tr><tr><td>양천구</td><td>2.7%</td></tr><tr><td>영등포구</td><td>3.3%</td></tr><tr><td>용산구</td><td>7%</td></tr><tr><td>은평구</td><td>6.7%</td></tr><tr><td>종로구</td><td>6.2%</td></tr><tr><td>중구</td><td>2.6%</td></tr><tr><td>중랑구</td><td>13.8%</td></tr></tbody>","en":"<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">District</th><th scope=\"col\">Direct deals</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Seoul</td><td>4.7%</td></tr><tr><td>강남구</td><td>3.3%</td></tr><tr><td>강동구</td><td>4.2%</td></tr><tr><td>강북구</td><td>4%</td></tr><tr><td>강서구